      "category": "Text",
      "text": "1. Reports on pending State legislation shall be made on the prescribed City forms. Form NYC 55 will be used for making a favorable recommendation. Form NYC 56 will be used for recommending disapproval. The detailed instructions on these forms with respect to their preparation and routing are to be carefully followed, except that all Albany mail should be addressed to the Legislative Representative as follows: Room 599, Ten Eyck Hotel, Albany, N. Y. These forms may be requisitioned from the Administrator of this office.",
